# Functions with singularities / zeros at interval endpoints.
approx log(x) in 0..1 degree 4 as f32 norational nosplit noreduce list 2
approx 1/x in 0..1 degree 4 as f32 norational nosplit noreduce list 2
approx 1/sqrt(x) in 0..1 degree 4 as f32 norational nosplit noreduce list 2
approx 1/x in 1e-3..1 degree 4 as f32 list 1
approx log(x) in 1..1.5 degree 5 as f32 norational nosplit noreduce list 1
approx sin(x) - 0.3 in 0..0.6 degree 4 as f32 norational nosplit noreduce list 1
